  "checkedOn": "2026-10-15",
  "notes": "CC0 game art reused for existing ARES fields, not engineering CAD. Originals are pinned to Git commits/blobs; support glTF is losslessly repacked to GLB. Soil/foliage metallic values, colours, glazing, lighting and assembly are changed at runtime. Rows, growth appearance and equipment are visual interpretation, not extra accounts or biological simulation. Original canopy materials are OPAQUE; glazing is runtime cutaway/transparency. Quaternius upstream License.txt misnames the pack Ultimate Platformer Pack; the author page independently confirms Ultimate Space Kit CC0. All assets are local, no external model/texture fetches. Art pass: ready-made platform/equipment/rail prefabs replace visible procedural primitives. Factory Kit atlas is embedded, with separate pinned image provenance. Original generator is a generic battery/power-unit visual, factory pipe machinery/valve a pump-station visual and factory window machine a climate housing; not engineering CAD or new on-chain purchases. No procedural terrain/noise or bespoke 3D hardware geometry is used in the current field view.",
